Upstream decision oracle: third-party material

This directory builds and links llama.cpp from vendor/llama-cpp, unmodified.
Its own files repeat small parts of llama.cpp at commit
8642541b255bfb5dc39cd351a178be09013a55d6:

- oracle.cpp mirrors server code it cannot call:
  - the prompt-size checks of a slot that cannot split its prompt, with their
    error messages (tools/server/server-context.cpp, update_slots, the
    !slot.can_split() branch at line 4058);
  - the max over each label group in send_decision
    (tools/server/server-context.cpp, line 2526);
  - the image-input refusal of the /v1/systemone handler
    (tools/server/server-context.cpp, line 6618);
  - the exception-to-status mapping of ex_wrapper (tools/server/server.cpp,
    line 61) and the status and type names of format_error_response
    (tools/server/server-common.cpp, line 93).
- test_access.h repeats the signatures of private members of
  server_decision_context (tools/server/server-decision.h).

